{"__formatVersion":2,"__revision":"92cb81aa337dfe31","__entryId":"diff","entry":{"sceneUI":["<div style=\"max-width:440px;margin:0 auto\" class=\"terminal-win\">\n      <div class=\"terminal-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>zsh — my-first-page</span></div>\n      <div class=\"terminal-body\">\n        <span><b class=\"terminal-p\">$</b> <b class=\"terminal-c\">git diff</b></span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\">diff --git a/index.html b/index.html</span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\">@@ -12,5 +12,5 @@</span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-r\">- &lt;button&gt;点我&lt;/button&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-g\">+ &lt;button class=\"btn btn-primary\"&gt;立即开始&lt;/button&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\">红色带 - 是删的，绿色带 + 是加的</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:440px;margin:0 auto\" class=\"terminal-win\">\n      <div class=\"terminal-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>zsh — my-first-page</span></div>\n      <div class=\"terminal-body\">\n        <span><b class=\"terminal-p\">$</b> <b class=\"terminal-c\">git diff HEAD~1 HEAD --stat</b></span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\"> index.html | 10 ++++++----</span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\"> style.css  | 12 ++++++++++++</span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\"> 2 files changed, 18 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)</span>\n        <span><b class=\"terminal-p\">$</b> <b class=\"terminal-c\">git diff HEAD~1 HEAD</b></span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\">再查看逐行明细，确认本轮 AI 修改内容</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:440px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;padding:8px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light);font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">\n        <span>Conversation</span><span>Commits 3</span><span>Checks ✓</span><span style=\"color:var(--text);font-weight:600;border-bottom:2px solid #fd8c73;padding-bottom:6px;margin-bottom:-9px\">Files changed 2</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light);font-size:12px\">\n        <b style=\"flex:1;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px\">📄 index.html</b>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:var(--green)\">+18</span> <span style=\"color:var(--red)\">−4</span></span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;padding:6px 0\">\n        <div style=\"padding:1px 14px;background:#ddf4ff;color:#57606a\">@@ -12,5 +12,5 @@</div>\n        <div style=\"padding:1px 14px;background:var(--red-light);color:var(--red)\">- &lt;button&gt;点我&lt;/button&gt;</div>\n        <div style=\"padding:1px 14px;background:var(--green-light);color:var(--green)\">+ &lt;button class=\"btn btn-primary\"&gt;立即开始&lt;/button&gt;</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:440px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center\">\n      <span style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px\">🤖 AI 完成一轮修改</span>\n      <span style=\"color:var(--text-3);font-size:12px\">→</span>\n      <span style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid #f0b429;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px\">🔍 git diff 逐行看</span>\n      <span style=\"color:var(--text-3);font-size:12px\">→</span>\n      <span style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px\">✅ git commit 提交记录</span>\n    </div>"],"sceneUI_en":["<div style=\"max-width:440px;margin:0 auto\" class=\"terminal-win\">\n      <div class=\"terminal-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>zsh — my-first-page</span></div>\n      <div class=\"terminal-body\">\n        <span><b class=\"terminal-p\">$</b> <b class=\"terminal-c\">git diff</b></span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\">diff --git a/index.html b/index.html</span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\">@@ -12,5 +12,5 @@</span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-r\">- &lt;button&gt;Click me&lt;/button&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-g\">+ &lt;button class=\"btn btn-primary\"&gt;Start now&lt;/button&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\">The red band - is deleted, the green band + is added</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:440px;margin:0 auto\" class=\"terminal-win\">\n      <div class=\"terminal-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>zsh — my-first-page</span></div>\n      <div class=\"terminal-body\">\n        <span><b class=\"terminal-p\">$</b> <b class=\"terminal-c\">git diff HEAD~1 HEAD --stat</b></span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\"> index.html | 10 ++++++----</span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\"> style.css | 12 ++++++++++++</span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\"> 2 files changed, 18 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)</span>\n        <span><b class=\"terminal-p\">$</b> <b class=\"terminal-c\">git diff HEAD~1 HEAD</b></span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\">Check the line-by-line details again to confirm the content of this round of AI modifications</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:440px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;padding:8px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light);font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">\n        <span>Conversation</span><span>Commits 3</span><span>Checks ✓</span><span style=\"color:var(--text);font-weight:600;border-bottom:2px solid #fd8c73;padding-bottom:6px;margin-bottom:-9px\">Files changed 2</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light);font-size:12px\">\n        <b style=\"flex:1;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px\">📄 index.html</b>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:var(--green)\">+18</span> <span style=\"color:var(--red)\">−4</span></span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;padding:6px 0\">\n        <div style=\"padding:1px 14px;background:#ddf4ff;color:#57606a\">@@ -12,5 +12,5 @@</div>\n        <div style=\"padding:1px 14px;background:var(--red-light);color:var(--red)\">- &lt;button&gt;Click me&lt;/button&gt;</div>\n        <div style=\"padding:1px 14px;background:var(--green-light);color:var(--green)\">+ &lt;button class=\"btn btn-primary\"&gt;Start now&lt;/button&gt;</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:440px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center\">\n      <span style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px\">🤖 AI finishes a round of changes</span>\n      <span style=\"color:var(--text-3);font-size:12px\">→</span>\n      <span style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid #f0b429;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px\">🔍 review git diff line by line</span>\n      <span style=\"color:var(--text-3);font-size:12px\">→</span>\n      <span style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px\">✅ git commit record</span>\n    </div>"],"anatomy":{"demo":"<div class=\"diff-anat\">\n      <span class=\"ap diff-line diff-f\" data-ap=\"file\" style=\"display:flex\">📄 <b>index.html</b></span>\n      <span class=\"ap diff-line diff-hunk\" data-ap=\"hunk\">@@ -12,5 +12,5 @@</span>\n      <span class=\"ap diff-line diff-del\" data-ap=\"minus\">- &lt;button&gt;点我&lt;/button&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"ap diff-line diff-add\" data-ap=\"plus\">+ &lt;button class=\"btn btn-primary\"&gt;立即开始&lt;/button&gt;</span>\n    </div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"diff-anat\">\n      <span class=\"ap diff-line diff-f\" data-ap=\"file\" style=\"display:flex\">📄 <b>index.html</b></span>\n      <span class=\"ap diff-line diff-hunk\" data-ap=\"hunk\">@@ -12,5 +12,5 @@</span>\n      <span class=\"ap diff-line diff-del\" data-ap=\"minus\">- &lt;button&gt;Click me&lt;/button&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"ap diff-line diff-add\" data-ap=\"plus\">+ &lt;button class=\"btn btn-primary\"&gt;Start now&lt;/button&gt;</span>\n    </div>","parts":[{"key":"file","cn":"文件头","en":"File Header","desc":"这段改动属于哪个文件，一个文件一段","desc_en":"Which file does this change belong to? One file and one section."},{"key":"hunk","cn":"位置标记","en":"Hunk @@","desc":"@@ -12,5 +12,5 @@：改动在第 12 行附近","desc_en":"@@ -12,5 +12,5 @@: Change near line 12"},{"key":"minus","cn":"删除行","en":"- Removed","desc":"红色带 - 号：旧版本有、新版本删掉的行","desc_en":"Red with - sign: lines that existed in the old version and deleted in the new version"},{"key":"plus","cn":"新增行","en":"+ Added","desc":"绿色带 + 号：新版本多出来的行","desc_en":"Green with a + sign: extra lines in the new version"}]},"variants":[{"cn":"看未暂存改动","en":"git diff","demo":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">git diff</span>","demo_en":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">git diff</span>","when":"查看工作区相对暂存区改了什么","when_en":"Check what has been changed in the workspace relative to the staging area"},{"cn":"看已暂存改动","en":"git diff --staged","demo":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">git diff --staged</span>","demo_en":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">git diff --staged</span>","when":"add 之后、commit 之前复核","when_en":"Review after add and before commit"},{"cn":"比较最近两次提交","en":"git diff commits","demo":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">git diff HEAD~1 HEAD</span>","demo_en":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">git diff HEAD~1 HEAD</span>","when":"复核最近一次提交的具体变化","when_en":"Review specific changes from the most recent commit"},{"cn":"两个分支比","en":"git diff main..feat","demo":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">git diff main..feat/dark-mode</span>","demo_en":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">git diff main..feat/dark-mode</span>","when":"合并前先看分支领先了多少","when_en":"Before merging, check how far ahead the branch is"}],"use":[{"t":"AI 完成一轮修改后，先看 Diff 再决定是否保存版本","m":"diff-unstaged"},{"t":"提交前分别检查尚未选择和已经选择的改动","m":"diff-last"},{"t":"在 Pull Request 的 Files changed 页面集中检查变化","m":"diff-github"},{"t":"看到大段删除时暂停确认，避免旧功能被意外移除","m":"diff-check"}],"dont":[{"t":"只看改了哪些文件，不看每个文件具体变化","m":"diff-blind-bad","bad":true},{"t":"一次出现大量无关变化仍直接 Commit","m":"diff-debug-bad","bad":true},{"t":"调试文字、临时文件或真实密钥仍在 Diff 中就提交","m":"diff-names-bad","bad":true},{"t":"只因为绿色很多就认为改动正确，仍要理解实际内容","m":"diff-sneak-bad","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"Agent 说“只改了按钮颜色”，但 `git status` 显示 12 个文件有变化，其中还有大段删除。提交前应该怎样确认？","options":[{"id":"review-both-diffs","label":"逐行检查未暂存和已暂存 Diff，确认误删、调试内容与密钥都不存在","feedback":"Diff 展示实际增删，分别检查两部分才能知道提交最终会包含什么。","correct":true},{"id":"file-count-only","label":"只看修改文件数量，只要按钮文件在列表里就直接提交","feedback":"文件名不能说明每行变化，其他文件中的误删和敏感内容仍可能进入提交。","correct":false},{"id":"green-means-correct","label":"看到新增绿色行很多就判断改动正确，不阅读删除内容","feedback":"颜色只表示增加或删除，不评价业务正确性；大段删除尤其需要停下来确认。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"An Agent says it only changed a button color, but `git status` shows 12 changed files and large deletions. What should happen before commit?","options":[{"id":"review-both-diffs","label":"Review unstaged and staged diffs line by line for deletion, debug content, and secrets","feedback":"Diff shows actual additions and removals, and both areas reveal what the final commit will contain.","correct":true},{"id":"file-count-only","label":"Check only the file count and commit as long as the button file appears","feedback":"Filenames do not reveal line changes, so other files may still contain deletion or sensitive content.","correct":false},{"id":"green-means-correct","label":"Assume many green additions mean correctness and skip reading removed content","feedback":"Colors indicate addition and removal, not business correctness; large deletions require explicit review.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"请在提交前分别展示未暂存和已暂存 Diff，按文件解释每项变化，并标记超出“按钮颜色”的内容。重点检查大段删除、调试文字、生成文件和真实密钥；我确认范围后再 Commit。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Before commit, show unstaged and staged diffs separately, explain each file, and flag anything beyond button color. Check large deletions, debug text, generated files, and real secrets, and wait for scope confirmation."}},"demoDetail":"<div class=\"git-story git-story--diff is-detail\">\n  <div class=\"git-story-main\"><div class=\"git-diff-visual\">\n      <div class=\"git-diff-card is-before\"><span>改动前</span><small>按钮文字</small><b><i>−</i> 点我</b></div>\n      <div class=\"git-diff-arrow\">→</div>\n      <div class=\"git-diff-card is-after\"><span>改动后</span><small>按钮文字</small><b><i>＋</i> 立即开始</b></div>\n    </div></div>\n  <div class=\"git-story-answer\"><span class=\"git-command\">git diff</span><p>Diff 是改动清单：红色减号表示删掉的内容，绿色加号表示新增的内容。提交前看一遍，确认没有误删、调试内容或密钥。\n</p></div>\n</div>","references":[{"title":"git-diff 官方文档","source":"git-scm","url":"https://git-scm.com/docs/git-diff","title_en":"Git - git-diff Documentation"}],"scenes":["终端 git diff","比较最近两个提交","GitHub Files changed 页","AI 修改后先 diff 再 commit"],"en":{"demoDetail":"<div class=\"git-story git-story--diff is-detail\">\n  <div class=\"git-story-main\"><div class=\"git-diff-visual\">\n      <div class=\"git-diff-card is-before\"><span>Before changes</span><small>Button text</small><b><i>−</i> Click me</b></div>\n      <div class=\"git-diff-arrow\">→</div>\n      <div class=\"git-diff-card is-after\"><span>After changes</span><small>Button text</small><b><i>＋</i> Start now</b></div>\n    </div></div>\n  <div class=\"git-story-answer\"><span class=\"git-command\">git diff</span><p>Diff is a list of changes: red minus signs indicate deleted content, and green plus signs indicate new content. Read it over before submitting to make sure there are no accidentally deleted, debugged content or keys.\n</p></div>\n</div>","use":[{"t":"Review work before a commit","m":"diff-unstaged"},{"t":"Compare two branches or commits","m":"diff-last"},{"t":"Understand a pull request","m":"diff-github"},{"t":"Find an accidental or missing change","m":"diff-check"}],"dont":[{"t":"Review only the filenames and skip the actual lines","m":"diff-blind-bad","bad":true},{"t":"Assume a small diff has a small product impact","m":"diff-debug-bad","bad":true},{"t":"Include formatting changes that hide the real edit","m":"diff-names-bad","bad":true},{"t":"Copy secrets into a diff shared outside the team","m":"diff-sneak-bad","bad":true}],"scenes":["Pre-commit review","Pull request","Bug investigation","Release comparison"],"sceneUI":["<div style=\"max-width:440px;margin:0 auto\" class=\"terminal-win\">\n      <div class=\"terminal-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>zsh — my-first-page</span></div>\n      <div class=\"terminal-body\">\n        <span><b class=\"terminal-p\">$</b> <b class=\"terminal-c\">git diff</b></span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\">diff --git a/index.html b/index.html</span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\">@@ -12,5 +12,5 @@</span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-r\">- &lt;button&gt;Click me&lt;/button&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-g\">+ &lt;button class=\"btn btn-primary\"&gt;Start now&lt;/button&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\">The red band - is deleted, the green band + is added</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:440px;margin:0 auto\" class=\"terminal-win\">\n      <div class=\"terminal-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>zsh — my-first-page</span></div>\n      <div class=\"terminal-body\">\n        <span><b class=\"terminal-p\">$</b> <b class=\"terminal-c\">git diff HEAD~1 HEAD --stat</b></span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\"> index.html | 10 ++++++----</span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\"> style.css | 12 ++++++++++++</span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\"> 2 files changed, 18 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)</span>\n        <span><b class=\"terminal-p\">$</b> <b class=\"terminal-c\">git diff HEAD~1 HEAD</b></span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\">Check the line-by-line details again to confirm the content of this round of AI modifications</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:440px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;padding:8px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light);font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">\n        <span>Conversation</span><span>Commits 3</span><span>Checks ✓</span><span style=\"color:var(--text);font-weight:600;border-bottom:2px solid #fd8c73;padding-bottom:6px;margin-bottom:-9px\">Files changed 2</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light);font-size:12px\">\n        <b style=\"flex:1;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px\">📄 index.html</b>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:var(--green)\">+18</span> <span style=\"color:var(--red)\">−4</span></span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;padding:6px 0\">\n        <div style=\"padding:1px 14px;background:#ddf4ff;color:#57606a\">@@ -12,5 +12,5 @@</div>\n        <div style=\"padding:1px 14px;background:var(--red-light);color:var(--red)\">- &lt;button&gt;Click me&lt;/button&gt;</div>\n        <div style=\"padding:1px 14px;background:var(--green-light);color:var(--green)\">+ &lt;button class=\"btn btn-primary\"&gt;Start now&lt;/button&gt;</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:440px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center\">\n      <span style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px\">🤖 AI finishes a round of changes</span>\n      <span style=\"color:var(--text-3);font-size:12px\">→</span>\n      <span style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid #f0b429;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px\">🔍 review git diff line by line</span>\n      <span style=\"color:var(--text-3);font-size:12px\">→</span>\n      <span style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px\">✅ git commit record</span>\n    </div>"],"variants":[{"demo":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">git diff</span>","when":"Check what has been changed in the workspace relative to the staging area"},{"demo":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">git diff --staged</span>","when":"Review after add and before commit"},{"demo":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">git diff HEAD~1 HEAD</span>","when":"Review specific changes from the most recent commit"},{"demo":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">git diff main..feat/dark-mode</span>","when":"Before merging, check how far ahead the branch is"}]},"usageMocks":{"diff-unstaged":"<div class=\"terminal-win\"><div class=\"terminal-body\"><span><b class=\"terminal-p\">$</b> <b class=\"terminal-c\">git diff</b></span><span class=\"terminal-r\">- &lt;button&gt;点我&lt;/button&gt;</span><span class=\"terminal-g\">+ &lt;button class=\"btn btn-primary\"&gt;立即开始&lt;/button&gt;</span><span class=\"terminal-d\">红色表示删除，绿色表示新增；显示尚未 add 的改动</span></div></div>","diff-last":"<div class=\"terminal-win\"><div class=\"terminal-body\"><span><b class=\"terminal-p\">$</b> <b class=\"terminal-c\">git diff HEAD~1 HEAD</b></span><span class=\"terminal-d\"> 2 files changed, 18 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)</span><span class=\"terminal-d\">明确比较最近两个提交</span></div></div>","diff-github":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row between\" style=\"width:100%\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">📄 index.html</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:var(--green)\">+18</span> <span style=\"color:var(--red)\">−4</span></span></div><span style=\"display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;font-size:12px;background:var(--red-light);color:var(--red);border-radius:3px;padding:1px 6px\">- 点我</span><span style=\"display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;font-size:12px;background:var(--green-light);color:var(--green);border-radius:3px;padding:1px 6px\">+ 立即开始</span></div>","diff-check":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">AI 完成修改</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">→</span><span class=\"mk-tag orange\">git diff 逐行检查</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">→</span><span class=\"mk-tag green\">commit 提交记录</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">确认改动符合预期后再提交</span>","diff-blind-bad":"<div class=\"terminal-win\"><div class=\"terminal-body\"><span><b class=\"terminal-p\">$</b> <b class=\"terminal-c\">git add . &amp;&amp; git commit -m \"AI 修改\"</b></span><span class=\"terminal-d\">47 files changed，未经过逐项检查</span><span class=\"terminal-r\">出现问题后，难以确认具体改动</span></div></div>","diff-debug-bad":"<div class=\"terminal-win\"><div class=\"terminal-body\"><span class=\"terminal-g\">+ console.log(\"test 123\")</span><span class=\"terminal-g\">+ // debugger;</span><span class=\"terminal-r\">临时调试代码被一并提交</span><span class=\"terminal-d\">在提交前通过 diff 移除调试代码</span></div></div>","diff-names-bad":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">3 files changed</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">仅查看文件列表，无法确认各行的具体改动</span></div>","diff-sneak-bad":"<div class=\"terminal-win\"><div class=\"terminal-body\"><span class=\"terminal-r\">- &lt;nav&gt;…整个导航栏…&lt;/nav&gt;</span><span class=\"terminal-r\">- &lt;footer&gt;…&lt;/footer&gt;</span><span class=\"terminal-g\">+ &lt;nav&gt;新导航&lt;/nav&gt;</span><span class=\"terminal-r\">删除范围包含页脚，需要确认是否符合预期</span></div></div>"}}}